<!--
    kuna-typevote: a value the type passes leave undefined takes the type its
    uses vote for (option typevote).

    The ghdec-subright image: put_u32_be(char *a0, uint4 a1) stores the four
    bytes of a1 big-endian. The parameter is declared uint4, but the
    instances the shifts read are left undefined4, so each shift printed a
    cast back to the declared type: *a0 = (char)((uint4)a1 >> 0x18).

    Stage: merge, ActionTypeVote: every op on a variable left undefinedN
    votes (logical shifts and zero extension unsigned, arithmetic shifts and
    signed compares signed, other integer ops numeric); the instances take
    the voted type, so the casts go.

    Pass 1 (default) prints the shifts without casts; pass 2 (typevote off)
    with them.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x100000">
8b4424048b54240889d1c1e918880889d1c1e910884801887002885003c38b442408f7642404
89d0c1e803c3
